### Anything That Could Not Be Done
**None.** All requirements and constraints were fully met:
- Zero clinical fields dropped (all fields mapped directly to the primary view or reachable via inline "More" drawers).
- Zero app Kotlin code modified; zero git commands run; zero emulator/adb dependencies used.
- All developer jargon ("Codex") completely eliminated from the visible user interface.
- 48 dp minimum touch targets with anti-wrapping styles enforced across all buttons and chips.

